1 NOTE Born in Stene and lived to 83; her marriage joined the Devriendt and Van Iseghem lines (children Diane, Rosette, Edi).
2 CONT
2 CONT CORROBORATED (July 2026) by a Doodsprentjes.be memorial-card record: born Stene
2 CONT 12 April 1908, died Oostende 22 September 1991, partner Van Iseghem. The birthplace of
