1 FAMC @F35@
1 NOTE Sister of [[guilielmus_bossin]], and the first of that generation this tree has besides
2 CONT him. Her marriage act — Sint-Stevens-Woluwe nr. 9, 1 December 1853 (S22) — names her
2 CONT parents as [[arnoldus_bossin]] and [[elisabeth_deyn]], exactly as her brother's 1846 act
2 CONT names his, and it is her brother who stands as a witness at her wedding.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was of age, born at Sint-Stevens-Woluwe on 3 November 1829 — a date the act gives to
2 CONT the day — living there still, and working as a *dagloonster*. Like almost everyone in the
2 CONT act, she declared herself unable to write.
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Françiscus Pardon, a servant of Zaventem. Banns were published in both
2 CONT communes on 20 and 27 November.
2 CONT
2 CONT `sup` rather than `doc`: this is AGATHA's transcription of the act, complete as it reads,
2 CONT and the register image itself is not linked from the page and has not been pulled.
