2 CONT very probably his parents, and his marriage to Joanna Theresia Ver Elst, which the
2 CONT Zaventem registers should hold for roughly 1815–1824. His daughter told the 1846 act that
2 CONT she had never known her grandparents nor where they died, so his parents are not reachable
2 CONT through her.
