2 CONT the West-Vlaanderen civil birth registers carries it as Diksmuide, **akte nr. 14, act
2 CONT date 24 January 1880**, child *Emma Celesta Vincke*, born Diksmuide — one day after the
2 CONT birth date held here, which is the ordinary gap between a birth and its declaration.
2 CONT Pulling the act itself would move her birth, and her parents [[lucien_vincke]] ×
2 CONT [[ludovica_vanald]], off a memorial card and a member tree and onto civil registration.
