2 CONT From Sint-Niklaas — she opens the deep Paelinck line, documented to ~1618.
2 CONT
2 CONT DOCUMENTED DATE (July 2026). Her birth act — Sint-Niklaas, **31 October 1901** — gives
2 CONT the day the tree had only as a year, and names both parents in the act itself:
2 CONT [[eduardus_p]] and [[magdalena_vb]]. Those two links stood on the stefpaelinck tree
2 CONT until now.
2 CONT
2 CONT FOUND ON FAMILYSEARCH (July 2026), after AGATHA had been recorded as a NOT FOUND for this
2 CONT same act. Her birth registration — Sint-Niklaas, **31 October 1901**, invoernummer **997** —
2 CONT is indexed in *Belgium, East Flanders, Civil Registration, 1541-1950*, with both parents
2 CONT attached: [[eduardus_p]] and [[magdalena_vb]] ([[S16]]).
2 CONT
2 CONT The correction to make here is not to the record but to how it was searched. AGATHA holds
2 CONT eight Paelinck entries for Sint-Niklaas and no births, and that was written up as though the
2 CONT act did not exist. It exists; one archive did not have it.
2 CONT
2 CONT REGISTER PAGE READ (July 2026). Not the index card this time but the act itself —
2 CONT Sint-Niklaas births 1901, image 268, act nr. 997 ([[leonie-paelinck-1901-birth-register]]).
2 CONT Her names are written out at the close of the act as *Philomena Leonia*, with her father and
